PRODUCT REQUIREMENTS DOCUMENT (PRD)
1. Product Overview
SPOT is a mobile-first, dark-themed location discovery platform that helps people find, save, and share hidden real-world places through community recommendations and intelligent, mood-first discovery. Unlike Google Maps (navigation) or Yelp (reviews), SPOT is built around intent and emotion — "I want peace," "Date night," "Weekend adventure."

One-Line Pitch: Discover places others haven't found yet.

2. Problem Statement
People struggle to find authentic, non-touristy places. Existing platforms:

Google Maps → Navigation-focused, cluttered, shows commercial places

Instagram → Aesthetic but not map-based, can't navigate to spots

Yelp/Zomato → Review-heavy, ad-driven, no category depth for treks/viewpoints/study spots

Word of mouth → Doesn't scale, lost in chats

3. Solution
A map-first discovery app with:

🎰 Vibe Roulette — spin for random mood + spot

🎭 Mood Pills — emotional shortcuts ("Date Night", "Peace & Quiet")

🔥 Live/Ephemeral Spots — spots pulse based on real-time activity, fade after 72hrs

💎 30 Categories — from Sunset Points to Hidden Ruins to First Date Spots

📸 Photography-first cards — large images, minimal text

💾 Save/Bookmark — personal collections

📤 Share — growth loop via WhatsApp/Instagram

